         v1 SHIPPED paths:
         1. scripts/repl.sh — interactive key auth + REPL
         2. Browser UI once image booted (HTTP on image port)
         3. Auth RPC for admin create_user / password / token
         4. scripts/verify_dream_product.sh automated gate

         DEFERRED:
